<title>UK: Sri Lanka buys one cargo white sugar at $338.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka buys one cargo white sugar at $338.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka has bought a cargo of white sugar at $338 per tonne, trade sources said.</p>
<p>According to one trader the deal was for low quality white sugar and was done with a South Korean company.</p>
</text>
